  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Starting at 6th level, whenever you or a friendly creature within 10 feet of you must make a saving throw, the creature gains a bonus to the saving throw equal to your Charisma modifier (with a minimum bonus of +1). You must be conscious to grant this bonus.</p>\n<p> At 18th level, the range of this aura increases to 30 feet.</p>\n<p><strong>midi-qol</strong>: Requires Aura Effects module. Uses an aura effect (allies, 10ft radius) that adds CHA modifier to saving throws. Adjust the distance formula to 30 for level 18+.</p>",
      "chat": "<p>Starting at 6th level, whenever you or a friendly creature within 10 feet of you must make a saving throw, the creature gains a bonus to the saving throw equal to your Charisma modifier (with a minimum bonus of +1). You must be conscious to grant this bonus.</p>\n<p> At 18th level, the range of this aura increases to 30 feet.</p>"
